# AB-002: Weak-acid conductometric titration distinguishes neutralisation from dilution
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.001mol
measure v1 conductivity
add v1 NaOH 0.00025mol
measure v1 conductivity
add v1 NaOH 0.00025mol
measure v1 conductivity
add v1 NaOH 0.0005mol
measure v1 conductivity
measure v1 ph
add v1 NaOH 0.0005mol
measure v1 conductivity
measure v1 ph
inspect
